<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg raised, General Mills cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg raised, General Mills cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Thursday it raised its long-term rating on Kellogg Co to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Cut long-term rating on General Mills Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Kept intermediate-term ratings on both companies at neutral.</p>
<p>-- Late Wednesday, General Mills announced it would increase cereal prices an average of 2.6 percent, the first price increases by the company in four years.</p>
</text>
